#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:13
#, python-format
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid ""
"Misago code checked out from the %(repository)s GitHub repository may be a "
"work in progress and should not be used to evaluate the software or run live "
"forums."
msgstr ""
"从 %(repository)s GitHub 仓库检出的 Misago 代码可能仍在开发中，不应用于评估该软"
"件或运行正式论坛。"

#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:18
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid ""
"Features may be missing, incomplete, or broken, and there may be no way to "
"upgrade the database to future versions."
msgstr ""
"功能可能缺失、不完整或存在缺陷，并且可能无法将数据库升级到未来的版本。"

#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:21
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid "To run a live forum, use one of the provided Docker images:"
msgstr "若要运行正式论坛，请使用以下提供的 Docker 镜像："

#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:25
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid "Misago Docker (official)"
msgstr "Misago Docker（官方）"

#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:28
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid "Misago Image (community)"
msgstr "Misago Image（社区）"

#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:32
#, python-format
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid ""
"To evaluate a released version on your machine, clone one of <a "
"href=\"%(release_tags_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">the release tags from "
"GitHub</a>."
msgstr ""
"若要在本地评估已发布的版本，请从 <a href=\"%(release_tags_url)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">GitHub 上的发布标签</a>中克隆任意一个。"

#: plugins/misago-dev-warning/misago_dev_warning/templates/misago_dev_warning/message.html:37
msgctxt "dev warning"
msgid "I understand"
msgstr "我明白了"
